            "The window and its round button now stay above the game's own screens.",
            "NEW"
        },
        {
            "🧹",
            "Only events that are on",
            "The panel now shows an event's switches only while the game runs it. Fool's Hunt and the April banner are out of the game, so their switches are hidden. If they come back, their switches do too. The same goes for the Summer Hunt when it ends.",
            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "🔥",
            "Legend Stages count their weaknesses",
            "Enemies on Legend Stages and some raids take much more damage from certain types, up to ×3.5 for some. The team search, the simulator and the buying now all count that, so a fire and ice stage gets your fire and ice units.",
            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "🪼",
            "Elyssia (Abyssal) can be picked",
            "Her upgrades were hidden, so the team search skipped her. They now come from her wiki page, and the simulator plays her jellies and eels. Every unit's numbers were checked against its live page too.",
            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "📐",
            "Three ways to place your team",
            "Before the first wave the simulator searches the best spots on the map for three layouts and picks by how strong your team is there. Beats enemies at 1.5× strength from the road's start: a fast clear. Beats a bit more than normal strength: spread over the road. Normal strength or lower: a kill box at the road's end, now with its own best spots. It works in every mode, dungeon rooms too, except Infinite and modes that deal your team. A layout that loses steps down to a safer one on the next try, and a room's last life is always a kill box.",
            "NEW"
        },
        {
            "🪜",
            "Tougher team test in dungeons",
            "A dungeon team swap now has to go further up the same rising test as every other mode, up to 24× enemy strength. A tie keeps your team.",
            "IMPROVED"
        },
        {
            "🌬️",
            "Windsongs where they're needed",
            "A buffer now gets only the copies that keep its buff up all the time. For Windsong that's 2 for each group of attackers, taking turns, so a force at the back gets its own pair. The rest of the yen goes to your attackers.",
            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "🔎",
            "A fresh team search before every run",
            "Auto-Equip Best Team used to go by a saved plan, even one made hours ago with different units. Now it searches before every run with the units and levels you have right then.",
            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "✨",
            "A new look",
            "Fewer tabs, one home for every control, shorter descriptions and a new neon theme. Home shows what it's doing and what to play, Goals what it's working toward, Team what makes your units stronger, Lobby what you choose by hand.",
            "IMPROVED"
        },
        {
            "🎯",
            "Choose what to evolve next",
            "The Units → Goals lists your 10 strongest evolutions, by the guides' rating and then the score at level 100. Pick one to focus on and its items and takedowns come first, or leave it on Smart Play and the farm chooses.",
            "NEW"
        },
        {
            "🔀",
            "Team swaps without the lobby",
            "A dungeon room that wants a different team now gets it as the room loads, before the first wave, instead of a trip to the lobby. No wave starts until all six are right, and if the swap fails the run goes to the lobby, which doesn't cost a try.",
            "NEW"
        },
        {
            "⏭️",
            "Next between story acts",
            "After a win the farm presses Next instead of going back to the lobby. The team is sorted out at the start of the next match, before the first wave: your training unit stays in if the simulator says the team still wins there, otherwise your own team goes back. It still stops at the lobby when the Units → Upgrades has work.",
            "NEW"
        },
        {
            "🗺️",
            "Story progress means new maps",
            "Farm Story Only now plays only acts you've never beaten. Hard runs of acts you've already beaten on Normal wait, and come back when the switch is off.",
            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "🧱",
            "The simulator plays stacked rooms",
            "In dungeon rooms your attackers stand together on the road's last stretch, and now the simulator plays them there too. It no longer calls a room lost at wave 7 when your team really gets to the boss, so its team picks and room picks go by what actually happens. Whether to take a curse is still judged the careful way.",
            "FIX"
        }
    }
})
table.insert(CHANGELOG, 2, {
    v = "1.6",
    date = "Oct 31, 2026",
    title = "A simpler window",
    items = {
