            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "🧠",
            "A smarter simulator",
            "It now counts how many times an attack hits (shields lose a point per hit), plays slows and stuns on the road, and stops regen on bleeding enemies, so slow units like Mochi get the credit they earn.",
            "IMPROVED"
