            "IMPROVED"
        },
        {
            "✨",
            "Abilities in the simulator",
            "It now plays Chuuni's marks, Iron Sentinel's drones, time stops, cooldown buffs, shield breaks and built-in crits, so those units get the credit they earn when it picks teams. Summons aren't played yet.",
            "IMPROVED"
        },
        {
            "🩸",
            "Enemy abilities in the simulator",
            "Enemies that heal, enemies that split when they die and enemies with barriers are now played too, so it sees the rooms that are really hard.",
            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "🧲",
            "Slows get bought",
            "A slow or a stun now counts for what it does for your other units, not just its own damage, so Mochi goes down early. And the simulator weighs upgrades the way the farm does, so it buys in nearly the same order.",
            "IMPROVED"
        },
        {
            "🧿",
            "Curses, more carefully",
            "A curse lasts to room 20, and a death loses every chest in the run. Past room 10, or with chests riding on the run, a curse is taken only if the simulator says your team still beats the rooms after it; past room 15, or with many chests, it has to beat them against 30% tougher enemies. A curse the simulator can't play (Chaos, Eruption, Armor, Burst) is passed when chests are riding. Shrines follow the same rule.",
            "IMPROVED"
        },
        {
            "🛒",
            "Shop buys for your team",
            "Items that boost one damage type are now judged by how much of your damage is that type, not how many units are. An item that does nothing for your team isn't bought at any price.",
            "FIX"
        },
        {
            "🛡️",
            "Illusionist's base guard",
            "Illusionist (Final)'s ability guards the base for 10 seconds and throws back what touches it, so the farm now fires it as an enemy reaches the base. It used to fire at 90% of the road, which spent nearly all of it before the enemy arrived.",
            "FIX"
        }
    }
})
